Need a miracle?

2
00:08:49,090 --> 00:08:55,090
Good Fortune is a comedy, fantasy film directed by Aziz Ansari.

3
00:13:13,636 --> 00:13:19,636
A well-meaning but rather inept angel named Gabriel meddles in the
lives of a struggling gig worker and a wealthy capitalist.

4
00:17:38,181 --> 00:17:44,181
Gabriel, played by Keanu Reeves.

5
00:22:02,727 --> 00:22:08,727
Arj / Delivery Robots (voice), played by Aziz Ansari.

6
00:26:27,272 --> 00:26:33,272
Jeff, played by Seth Rogen.

7
00:30:51,818 --> 00:30:57,818
Elena, played by Keke Palmer.

8
00:35:16,363 --> 00:35:22,363
Martha, played by Sandra Oh.

9
00:39:40,909 --> 00:39:46,909
Linda, played by Sherry Cola.

10
00:44:05,454 --> 00:44:11,454
Good Fortune is a 2025 American comedy-drama film written and
directed by Aziz Ansari in his feature directorial debut.

11
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:36,000
Seth Rogen, Ansari, Keke Palmer, Sandra Oh and Keanu Reeves star in the film.

12
00:52:54,545 --> 00:53:00,545
It is produced by Garam Films, Oh Brudder
Productions, Keep Your Head, and Yang Pictures.

13
00:57:19,090 --> 00:57:25,090
It follows an angel named Gabriel (Reeves), whose failed attempt to show Arj (Ansari), a struggling man, that money does not solve one's problems—by body swapping
him with his wealthy employer Jeff (Rogen)—results in Gabriel losing his wings, while the work he did as an angel begins to unravel around them.

14
01:01:43,636 --> 01:01:49,636
After the suspension of his original directorial debut Being Mortal at Searchlight
Pictures in 2022, Ansari moved forward with plans to direct Good Fortune.

15
01:06:08,181 --> 01:06:14,181
He wanted to make a comedy to be released in theaters, citing the success of
Barbie (2023) as proof of the viability of such a project.

16
01:10:32,727 --> 01:10:38,727
Ansari's longtime friend Rogen, who inspired several elements of the
film, joined shortly after Being Mortal was shelved.

17
01:14:57,272 --> 01:15:03,272
The film was set to begin principal photography in May 2023, but due to a production shutdown in the middle of the month due to the
2023 Writers Guild of America strike, filming started in late January 2024 in Los Angeles, when Palmer joined the cast.

18
01:19:21,818 --> 01:19:27,818
The majority of filming wrapped before April 2024, with some scenes picked up later
after an injury Reeves sustained two weeks into filming had healed.

19
01:23:46,363 --> 01:23:52,363
Good Fortune premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 6, 2025,
and was released in the United States on October 17, 2025 by Lionsgate.

20
01:28:10,909 --> 01:28:16,909
The film received positive reviews from critics, and has earned
over $26 million against a budget of $30 million.

21
01:32:35,454 --> 01:32:41,454
The tone is lighthearted.
